    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Betrayed. Left to die. Now, you awaken in a fractured cybernetic reality, your mind and body fused with deadly and cutting-edge cybertronic abilities. The corruption that created you thinks you are gone, but they will soon learn how wrong they are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/404dd135e61b51f31571dae9cbf91700.poster.avif?t=1742954274\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/404dd135e61b51f31571dae9cbf91700.webm?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/404dd135e61b51f31571dae9cbf91700.mp4?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/4bacafa1b16ad2a64d783b9fbccac7f6.avif?t=1742954274\" width=480 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a deadly arsenal of cyber-enhanced attacks, single blade, dual daggers, and devastating special abilities. Every strike is precise. Every move is lethal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/7a1d21ed69915dff5f00d71bde10df17.poster.avif?t=1742954274\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/7a1d21ed69915dff5f00d71bde10df17.webm?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/7a1d21ed69915dff5f00d71bde10df17.mp4?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/3d7fd48a19e71e1d0a305d7a7d6953b9.avif?t=1742954274\" width=480 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through the woodlands, neon-lit city streets, high-tech facilities, and corporate towers. Reality bends in cyber challenges, where the player must face delusions of their past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/2f9770f9174c30583b7e0a525fc6b568.poster.avif?t=1742954274\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/2f9770f9174c30583b7e0a525fc6b568.webm?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/2f9770f9174c30583b7e0a525fc6b568.mp4?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/d70f2aeb847da961b868adb53ab8f185.avif?t=1742954274\" width=520 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a relentless army of corporate enforcers, drones, and cybernetic assassins. Adapt to new enemy types and survive the evolving battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/7dce5c33bc345ef15b521b4be5aa493c.poster.avif?t=1742954274\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/7dce5c33bc345ef15b521b4be5aa493c.webm?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/7dce5c33bc345ef15b521b4be5aa493c.mp4?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/f7a7660dac5dbed2af6c3c304aa4d806.avif?t=1742954274\" width=520 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your weapons, increase your combat abilities, and unlock powerful new skills and techniques to become the ultimate samurai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/3c3f13b5974878a03bff321145838cab.poster.avif?t=1742954274\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/3c3f13b5974878a03bff321145838cab.webm?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/3c3f13b5974878a03bff321145838cab.mp4?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to slice your path through the heart of the corruption?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Betrayed. Left to die. Now, you awaken in a fractured cybernetic reality, your mind and body fused with deadly and cutting-edge cybertronic abilities. The corruption that created you thinks you are gone, but they will soon learn how wrong they are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/404dd135e61b51f31571dae9cbf91700.poster.avif?t=1742954274\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/404dd135e61b51f31571dae9cbf91700.webm?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/404dd135e61b51f31571dae9cbf91700.mp4?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/4bacafa1b16ad2a64d783b9fbccac7f6.avif?t=1742954274\" width=480 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a deadly arsenal of cyber-enhanced attacks, single blade, dual daggers, and devastating special abilities. Every strike is precise. Every move is lethal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/7a1d21ed69915dff5f00d71bde10df17.poster.avif?t=1742954274\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/7a1d21ed69915dff5f00d71bde10df17.webm?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/7a1d21ed69915dff5f00d71bde10df17.mp4?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/3d7fd48a19e71e1d0a305d7a7d6953b9.avif?t=1742954274\" width=480 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through the woodlands, neon-lit city streets, high-tech facilities, and corporate towers. Reality bends in cyber challenges, where the player must face delusions of their past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/2f9770f9174c30583b7e0a525fc6b568.poster.avif?t=1742954274\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/2f9770f9174c30583b7e0a525fc6b568.webm?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/2f9770f9174c30583b7e0a525fc6b568.mp4?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/d70f2aeb847da961b868adb53ab8f185.avif?t=1742954274\" width=520 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a relentless army of corporate enforcers, drones, and cybernetic assassins. Adapt to new enemy types and survive the evolving battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/7dce5c33bc345ef15b521b4be5aa493c.poster.avif?t=1742954274\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/7dce5c33bc345ef15b521b4be5aa493c.webm?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/7dce5c33bc345ef15b521b4be5aa493c.mp4?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/f7a7660dac5dbed2af6c3c304aa4d806.avif?t=1742954274\" width=520 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your weapons, increase your combat abilities, and unlock powerful new skills and techniques to become the ultimate samurai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/3c3f13b5974878a03bff321145838cab.poster.avif?t=1742954274\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/3c3f13b5974878a03bff321145838cab.webm?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/3c3f13b5974878a03bff321145838cab.mp4?t=1742954274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to slice your path through the heart of the corruption?</p>",
